  <div class="legal-page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="legal-meta">Effective: Q2 2026</div>

    <p>TRT Compass LLC ("we," "our," or "us") operates this website and is committed to protecting your privacy. This policy explains what data we collect, how we use it, and what controls you have.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>We collect minimal data necessary to operate our affiliate business:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Anonymous analytics:</strong> We use a lightweight beacon script to record page views and basic referrer data. No personally identifiable information is collected through this method.</li>
      <li><strong>Affiliate links:</strong> When you click a clinic link, we may pass a referrer token to the clinic. This allows us to attribute commission-generating purchases. No personal data is shared unless you voluntarily submit it to the clinic.</li>
      <li><strong>No account data:</strong> TRT Compass does not require you to create an account, subscribe to a newsletter, or submit any personal information to use our site.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
    <p>TRT Compass uses a first-party anonymous visitor ID cookie to support basic analytics. We do not use third-party tracking pixels, behavioral advertising, or cross-site tracking. We do not sell or share any data with data brokers.</p>

    <h2>Clinic links and external sites</h2>
    <p>Our site contains links to third-party TRT clinics. Those clinics are governed by their own privacy policies. We recommend reviewing their policies before submitting any personal information.</p>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p>Anonymous analytics data is retained for 12 months in aggregate form. No individual-level data is stored longer than 90 days.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Because we collect no personally identifiable data beyond anonymous analytics, there is no user account data to request, correct, or delete. If you have questions, contact us at the address below.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy periodically. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated effective date.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy-related questions: <strong>privacy@trtcompass.com</strong></p>
  </div>

